        "node_id": "n_3_f0a9a9",
        "thought_text": "Use a modified merge sort algorithm to detect inversions. If there are exactly two inversions, check if reversing the subsequence between the inversion points results in a sorted array. If so, output the indices; otherwise, output 'impossible'.",
